## Phase 3: Post-Upgrade Cleanup & Verification

  1. #### Reset Permissions
      ** Crucial step to prevent white-screen-of-death errors): **
    
      ``` bash
      find . -type d -not -perm 2755 -exec chmod 2755 {} \;
      find . -type f -not -perm 0644 -exec chmod 0644 {} \;
      chown -R www-data:www-data .
      ```

  1. ### restart nginx
     Restart your web server or PHP-FPM service to clear memory buffers.
     ```bash
     sudo systemctl restart nginx


